style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>)/2 也是该方程组的解。更一般地，如果 α_{1}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + α_{2}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 也是解，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">α_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">α_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须满足什么条件？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某工厂生产三种产品，需要三种原材料。投入系数矩阵 A 和最终需求向量 d 已知，建立并求解列昂季耶夫方程 (I−A)x = d。讨论什么条件下方程有正解（经济含义：各部门的产出为正）。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>线性方程组的求解是计算数学最核心的问题之一。大规模线性方程组的高效求解推动了现代数值线性代数的发展。LAPACK 和 BLAS 是求解线性方程组的标准软件库，广泛应用于科学计算和工程仿真。</p>\n<p>在密码学中，Hill 密码基于矩阵乘法加密信息，解密则需要求解线性方程组（逆矩阵运算）。在编码理论中，纠错码（如汉明码）的校验过程也归结为线性方程组。</p>\n<p>对于竞赛选手，线性方程组理论与组合数学的交叉是一个有趣的方向。例如用线性代数方法证明组合恒等式，或利用有限域上的线性方程组构造组合设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>线性方程组是线性代数理论和应用的汇聚点。高斯消元法提供了通用的求解算法，秩理论给出了解的存在性和唯一性的完整判据，解的结构定理揭示了齐次解和特解的叠加关系。从电路分析到经济建模，从数据拟合到密码学，线性方程组的求解能力是数学应用的基石。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 线性方程组","id":"理科方向-数学进阶-线性方程组"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"高斯消元法的系统过程","id":"高斯消元法的系统过程"},{"level":3,"text":"齐次方程组的解空间","id":"齐次方程组的解空间"},{"level":3,"text":"非齐次方程的解的结构","id":"非齐次方程的解的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"方程组理论的应用","id":"方程组理论的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"计算复杂度","id":"计算复杂度"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 行列式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/advanced-algebra/determinants"},"next":{"title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 数论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/competition-math/number-theory"}}